{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-80edd4513f86b103", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t                                             CODA: CASCADED ONLINE DISCONTINUITY-AWARE ALIGNMENT\n2\t                                                  FOR REAL-TIME IMAGE-BASED SCORE FOLLOWING\n3\t\n4\t                                                                      Yining Yang1∗      Ruogu Chen2∗      Jie Han2\n5\t                                                                1\n6\t                                                                  Don Wright Faculty of Music, Western University, Canada\n7\t                                                     2\n8\t                                                       Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, University of Alberta, Canada\n9\t                                                                         yyang524@uwo.ca, ruogu@ualberta.ca, jhan8@ualberta.ca\n10\t                                                                                                           ∗\n11\t                                                                                                               Equal contribution\n12\t\n13\t\n14\t\n15\t                                                                     ABSTRACT                                             [3–5]. However, these methods require a symbolic score\n16\t                                                                                                                          such as MIDI or MusicXML, which is not always avail-\n17\t                                         Real-time score following from sheet images remains chal-\n18\t                                                                                                                          able.\n19\t                                         lenging because the model must process streaming au-\n20\t                                         